w-content-ltr" lang="en" dir="ltr"><div class="mw-parser-output"><p>Welcome to the official Mirage Realms Wiki! If you would like to get involved with maintaining the Wiki or have some things you would like to add, please get in touch via the <b>#wiki</b> channel in <b><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://discord.gg/7MHQaTjjMR">Discord</a></b> and we'll help you get started.
</p><p>This is a large community-driven project so please show some massive love to everyone involved in making this happen! It would not be here without them!
</p><p><br />
</p>
